   gutter remains visible on each side. The page itself is white at the top
   and its organic SVG starts below the header. The old BODY color therefore
   appeared as two darker rectangular blocks.

   Fix:
   Paint BODY with a full-height WHITE canvas plus very soft radial color
   fields at the two TOP corners. They fade to pure white BEFORE the inner
   gutter edge and also fade vertically, so there is:
   - no rectangle,
   - no vertical hard line,
   - no horizontal cutoff,
